  "releaseNotes": "- fix: event handlers no longer `AVal.force` CONCRETE per-row item fields (Story-A `AList.map (fun item -> …)` lambdas splice item fields as plain values; forcing them was a type error) — only Outer-mode model fields force\n- fix: conditional/match lift strips FCS's CE-statement `builder@.Yield(…)` wrapper from the branches (it leaked into the emitted `AVal.map` lambda as the bogus `builder_`); branches now yield the bare node and the lifted conditional lands on the builder's `Yield(aval<Node>)`\n- fix: multi-line CE blocks embedded mid-expression (a lifted conditional's branch) emit with column-aware indentation — body lines + closing `}` indent relative to the block's start column, so the output is offside-correct anywhere\n- wombatFable profile: `Dom.Value` removed from the attr-lift list — the portable surface pairs every attribute with an aval overload, so substitution resolves it directly (cleaner codegen than the `AVal.map` wrap)",
  "title": "Adaptify.PureView.MSBuild",
